B.QY=new A.a5(B.a_,["Ufa! Meu canh\xe3o estava louco para sair daqui. Bora derrubar uns chefes!","Phew! My cannon was dying to get out of here. Let's take down some bosses!","\xa1Uf! Mi ca\xf1\xf3n ten\xeda muchas ganas de salir. \xa1Vamos a derribar jefes!"],t.w)
